title: 주5_금_3교시_정문_양나현_영문
---
<<show hyun_idle>>
<<play hyun_sound>>
(As I walk out of the main gate, I see a familiar back.)
{name()}: NaHyun.
<<show hyun_shock>>
NaHyun: {name()}! Perfect timing.
{name()}: Is something up?
NaHyun: Help me find Bong-won.
{name()}: Bong-won? Sure.
<<show hyun_idle>>
<<play 공통_부스럭>>
(At NaHyun's request, I thoroughly searched through the bushes to find Bong-won.)
(But the cat is nowhere to be seen.)
NaHyun: That's weird. Where could he be?
(Exhausted, we sat down on the ground for a moment.)
<<play 공통_야옹>>
Bong-won: Meow~
(I hear Bong-won's meow.)
(He wasn't in the bushes we searched; he was sitting on a window sill right above where we were looking.)
(Bong-won lightly jumped down and landed perfectly right in front of us.)
<<play 양나현_허>>
<<show hyun_shock>>
NaHyun: We were looking in the completely wrong place.
{name()}: Tell me about it. It didn't occur to me to look up...
{name()}: Why were you looking for him anyway?
<<show hyun_smile>>
NaHyun: I bought this for him.
(NaHyun rummages through her bag and pulls out a cat treat.)
NaHyun: Since I won't be able to see him for a while once the semester ends...
NaHyun: I heard cats absolutely love these.
(NaHyun tears open the treat and offers it to Bong-won.)
Bong-won: !!
(Bong-won starts licking the treat enthusiastically.)
NaHyun: He must like it. He's devouring it.
NaHyun: So cute.
{name()}: He really is.
(We sat in front of Bong-won and watched him enjoy his meal.)
<<choice 주5_금_3교시_정문_양나현_긍정1_영문 "Sure. Just stay like that for a second." 주5_금_3교시_정문_양나현_부정1_영문 "My hands are full right now...">>
NaHyun: Can you take a picture of me with Bong-won?
===

title: 주5_금_3교시_정문_양나현_긍정1_영문
---
{name()}: Sure. Just stay like that for a second.
<<jump 주5_금_3교시_정문_양나현_분기1_영문>>
===

title: 주5_금_3교시_정문_양나현_부정1_영문
---
{name()}: My hands are full right now...
<<show hyun_neg>>
NaHyun: How about setting your things down on the ground for a moment?
<<change lvHyun -5>>
<<dislike 양나현>>
{name()}: Oh, r-right.
<<jump 주5_금_3교시_정문_양나현_분기1_영문>>
===

title: 주5_금_3교시_정문_양나현_분기1_영문
---
<<play 공통_셔터>>
(I captured NaHyun holding the treat with Bong-won in a single shot.)
(Bong-won looked toward the camera with his ears perked up, as if he knew he was being photographed.)
(I think I got the money shot.)
{name()}: How's this?
(I show the photos to NaHyun.)
<<show hyun_smile>>
NaHyun: Thanks! This came out so well.
<<choice 주5_금_3교시_정문_양나현_긍정2_영문 "Sure. I just hold it like this, right?" 주5_금_3교시_정문_양나현_부정2_영문 "I'm good, thanks.">>
NaHyun: Do you want to try feeding him too?
===

title: 주5_금_3교시_정문_양나현_긍정2_영문
---
{name()}: Sure. I just hold it like this, right?
(I take the treat from NaHyun.)
NaHyun: Yeah. He's eating it so well.
(As I held out the treat, Bong-won licked it up eagerly.)
<<show hyun_blush>>
NaHyun: How cute. Can I take a picture of you?
{name()}: Uh, sure.
<<play 공통_셔터>>
(NaHyun pulled out her phone and snapped a photo.)
<<if get("lvHyun") >= 70>>
    <<jump 주5_금_3교시_정문_양나현_분기2_영문>>
<<else>>
    <<end>>
<<endif>>
===

title: 주5_금_3교시_정문_양나현_부정2_영문
---
{name()}: I'm good, thanks.
<<change lvHyun -5>>
<<dislike 양나현>>
<<show hyun_idle>>
NaHyun: Oh, okay then...
<<play 공통_야옹>>
(Bong-won finished the treat and let out a satisfied meow.)
NaHyun: He must be full.
NaHyun: Should we head out?
<<end>>
===

title: 주5_금_3교시_정문_양나현_분기2_영문
---
<<play 양나현_웃음>>
(NaHyun looks at the photo and laughs.)
<<show hyun_smile>>
NaHyun: You both look so adorable.
NaHyun: I'm going to treasure this photo.
<<end>>
===